WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 8]

01:40.280 --> 01:41.730
While we're already bound by the betrothal arrangement,

01:41.870 --> 01:42.890
I still wish to know you

01:43.120 --> 01:44.090
better.

01:44.910 --> 01:45.490
I see

01:45.640 --> 01:46.940
you're still averse to me.

01:47.800 --> 01:48.330
You think

01:48.880 --> 01:50.700
you're above a man of my lowly background, don't you?

01:51.350 --> 01:52.530
Not at all.

01:52.800 --> 01:53.810
Then what?

01:54.600 --> 01:55.490
Why are you afraid of me?

01:56.710 --> 01:57.420
Senior Lu,

01:57.800 --> 01:58.490
there are people here.

01:58.600 --> 01:59.420
Behave.

02:00.870 --> 02:02.420
You're adorable when you're shy.

02:03.510 --> 02:04.490
There is no one here.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.010
Him again.

02:13.110 --> 02:13.820
Senior Lu.

02:14.710 --> 02:16.180
Why do you like to pick on him?

02:16.520 --> 02:17.940
He picked on me first.

02:18.110 --> 02:19.370
His Foundation Pill

02:19.640 --> 02:20.860
should have been mine.

02:22.200 --> 02:22.730
Han Li!

02:23.200 --> 02:24.090
Stand right there!

02:34.840 --> 02:35.410
Senior Lu,

02:36.560 --> 02:37.500
ever since I entered the valley,

02:37.920 --> 02:39.050
I have done nothing but concede.

02:39.670 --> 02:41.460
Why must you back me into a corner?

02:42.400 --> 02:43.490
You know very well why.

02:43.920 --> 02:44.850
Give me back the Foundation Pill

02:45.480 --> 02:47.690
or be the fertilizer to the forest.

03:19.710 --> 03:20.690
You've done nothing wrong

03:20.870 --> 03:21.850
but you stick out like a sore thumb

03:22.310 --> 03:24.490
because you possess something you shouldn't have.

03:35.920 --> 03:36.490
What are you doing?

03:40.480 --> 03:42.210
This is between him and me.

03:43.000 --> 03:44.410
Please stay out of this, Mentor Wu.

04:06.080 --> 04:08.220
I didn't teach you magic to hurt your peers.

04:09.280 --> 04:11.260
Before I came here, I fought with my life

04:11.960 --> 04:12.660
on the Tianwu Arena

04:12.680 --> 04:14.170
before I was offered a Foundation Pill.

04:15.000 --> 04:16.060
Yet he simply

04:16.560 --> 04:18.500
took my spot with a show of his Ascension Token.

04:18.520 --> 04:19.940
It was only reasonable for me to be angry!

04:20.190 --> 04:21.380
The Sect Master and the elders

04:21.750 --> 04:23.450
decide who can have the Foundation Pill.

04:24.150 --> 04:25.940
If you have issues with their decision, appeal to them.

04:26.870 --> 04:28.380
I want fairness!

04:29.430 --> 04:31.290
The prestigious cultivators already look down on me.

04:32.150 --> 04:33.820
He's just a rogue cultivator with a fake spirit root.

04:34.310 --> 04:36.170
How come he gets to steal my thunder too?

04:36.310 --> 04:37.340
You have accepted

04:37.360 --> 04:38.820
the compensation gems we offered

04:39.400 --> 04:40.940
so you're no longer entitled to the pill.

04:41.630 --> 04:43.690
You still have a chance to get it in the future.

04:44.120 --> 04:45.170
Just work hard for it when the time comes.

04:47.360 --> 04:47.940
Senior Lu.

04:48.360 --> 04:48.850
Let's go.

04:48.960 --> 04:49.890
Let's not blow this out of proportion.

04:53.080 --> 04:53.690
Han Li.

04:54.680 --> 04:55.340
You will never

04:56.000 --> 04:56.730
hear the end of me.

04:57.870 --> 04:58.610
You won't

04:58.630 --> 05:00.410
be so lucky next time.

05:18.400 --> 05:18.940
Are you all right?

05:20.400 --> 05:21.220
Thank you, Mentor Wu.

05:23.910 --> 05:25.730
He was right.

05:27.360 --> 05:28.130
You've done nothing wrong,

05:28.870 --> 05:29.660
but you stick out like a sore thumb.

05:31.590 --> 05:33.410
There's only one way for you

05:34.310 --> 05:35.100
to keep your Foundation Pill.

05:36.840 --> 05:38.340
Get to Tier 13 as soon as possible

05:38.360 --> 05:39.290
and ingest it.

05:40.630 --> 05:41.570
It's the only way.

06:04.120 --> 06:04.980
Do I

06:06.360 --> 06:07.540
not deserve the pill?

06:22.800 --> 06:23.540
Senior Lu.

06:25.000 --> 06:26.580
Calm down, Senior Lu.

06:28.830 --> 06:29.490
Senior Lu.

06:30.510 --> 06:31.370
Calm down!

06:31.560 --> 06:32.410
I am calm.

06:32.920 --> 06:34.100
You're digging your own grave here.

06:34.240 --> 06:36.410
I fought for that pill for you!

06:36.800 --> 06:38.810
Only by reaching the Foundation Establishment Stage that I am deserving of you.

06:39.830 --> 06:40.340
Senior...

06:45.800 --> 06:48.580
Didn't they offer you 300 gems as compensation?

06:48.950 --> 06:49.780
That's a lot.

06:50.510 --> 06:52.340
No need to take any tasks from me anymore.

06:52.600 --> 06:53.490
That's not compensation.

06:53.870 --> 06:54.930
It was a robbery.

07:02.390 --> 07:02.900
Mentor,

07:04.600 --> 07:05.490
I was told

07:06.160 --> 07:06.900
that you

07:07.190 --> 07:08.100
know a way to obtain a Foundation Pill.

07:09.830 --> 07:11.410
I do.

07:12.360 --> 07:13.610
But it costs a lot.

07:14.720 --> 07:15.700
Are you

07:15.950 --> 07:17.340
going to splurge?

07:20.190 --> 07:21.170
300 gems.

07:21.560 --> 07:21.980
Take it.

07:25.070 --> 07:26.140
300 gems.

07:26.480 --> 07:27.490
You won't keep anything for yourself?

07:27.830 --> 07:28.930
Gems are nothing

07:29.480 --> 07:30.850
compared to a Foundation Pill.

07:36.160 --> 07:37.020
Wait for my good news.

07:39.800 --> 07:40.660
Thank you.

08:06.800 --> 08:07.780
Have you made up your mind?

08:08.430 --> 08:08.980
Almost.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.050
Are you done?

08:23.480 --> 08:23.980
Mentor,

08:24.480 --> 08:25.170
ten books in total.

08:25.600 --> 08:26.170
Ten books.

08:26.270 --> 08:26.930
20 gems.

08:27.190 --> 08:28.370
Leave the gems here and you can go.

09:02.680 --> 09:03.780
18...

09:06.720 --> 09:07.930
That's not good.

09:08.360 --> 09:09.020
18 gems.

09:09.070 --> 09:09.730
Leave one book behind.

09:09.750 --> 09:10.490
Take nine books.

09:13.720 --> 09:14.220
Mentor,

09:14.750 --> 09:15.780
can you help me out?

09:16.360 --> 09:17.020
No.

09:18.070 --> 09:19.930
It took me a while to pick those books.

09:21.040 --> 09:21.850
Perhaps when I...

09:21.870 --> 09:22.340
Fine.

09:22.920 --> 09:23.580
Just this once.

09:23.600 --> 09:24.220
Don't do it again.

09:24.800 --> 09:25.460
Go.

09:25.870 --> 09:26.580
Thank you, Mentor.

09:34.830 --> 09:35.410
Don't move.

09:38.750 --> 09:39.290
If I

09:39.430 --> 09:40.610
treat your swollen neck,

09:40.750 --> 09:41.250
is my effort

09:41.630 --> 09:42.290
worth two gems?

09:43.240 --> 09:44.290
You can heal?

09:45.120 --> 09:45.930
You never mention it.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.290
Have you been

10:01.560 --> 10:03.780
ingesting supplements imbued with the fire element?

10:04.630 --> 10:05.340
No.

10:05.870 --> 10:06.370
No?

10:09.750 --> 10:11.220
Perhaps I've spent

10:11.440 --> 10:12.980
too much time at Dihuo Palace lately.

10:14.630 --> 10:15.700
Not bad.

10:16.200 --> 10:17.180
You hide many tricks.

10:21.750 --> 10:22.490
It's swollen

10:22.750 --> 10:23.700
because the heat

10:23.910 --> 10:24.700
has pervaded your body.

10:25.030 --> 10:25.850
I need to cut it open.

10:26.360 --> 10:27.370
I'll gather some poisonous herbs

10:27.510 --> 10:28.370
and make a numbing soup.

10:28.600 --> 10:29.340
After you drink it,

10:29.720 --> 10:30.610
it won't hurt when I cut it.

10:33.080 --> 10:33.490
Han Li.

10:35.600 --> 10:36.300
Come back.

10:37.720 --> 10:39.060
Just cut it open now.

10:40.390 --> 10:41.980
No need to numb it.

10:42.150 --> 10:43.650
It's bothering me so much.

10:43.840 --> 10:44.370
Come.

10:45.870 --> 10:46.890
It's going to hurt a lot.

10:47.630 --> 10:49.730
Not being able to sleep or eat is worse.

10:49.960 --> 10:50.730
Just do it.

10:52.510 --> 10:53.060
Come.

10:55.630 --> 10:56.530
Hurry up.

11:01.870 --> 11:03.010
Liar.

11:04.550 --> 11:05.340
I can't

11:05.510 --> 11:06.340
count on him at all.

11:15.550 --> 11:16.580
It hurts.

11:38.960 --> 11:39.490
Mentor.

11:40.200 --> 11:40.700
Come.

11:43.390 --> 11:44.370
Are you sure?

11:51.600 --> 11:52.530
Listen.

11:52.670 --> 11:53.770
If you botch it,

11:54.960 --> 11:56.100
I'll make you pay.

12:09.240 --> 12:10.060
It's true?

12:11.390 --> 12:12.130
What is?

12:16.910 --> 12:17.940
I've read that some patients

12:18.840 --> 12:20.460
had a bird coming out of their shoulder.

12:21.080 --> 12:22.060
It hid under the skin

12:23.000 --> 12:23.850
like a tumor

12:24.270 --> 12:25.180
or a lump.

12:25.750 --> 12:27.010
You can hear a bird's chirping from within.

12:27.550 --> 12:28.340
When it's cold or hungry,

12:28.550 --> 12:29.490
you'll feel pain.

12:30.870 --> 12:32.530
Once one uses a silver blade to slice its feet,

12:33.240 --> 12:34.100
the bird

12:34.550 --> 12:36.010
will fly out.

12:38.120 --> 12:39.530
The fire energy

12:39.630 --> 12:40.580
has taken a form.

12:44.440 --> 12:44.850
Come.

12:45.270 --> 12:46.010
I'll apply some ointment.

13:06.120 --> 13:06.490
Brilliant!

13:11.150 --> 13:11.610
What do you think?

13:12.960 --> 13:14.300
It's treated.

13:19.390 --> 13:20.220
Who would have thought

13:20.440 --> 13:21.770
that you could heal too?

13:22.510 --> 13:24.180
You have a knack

13:24.320 --> 13:25.530
for medicine and herbs.

13:27.630 --> 13:28.010
Here.

13:28.870 --> 13:29.980
Your reward for treating me.

13:31.000 --> 13:31.460
Keep it.

13:34.120 --> 13:34.650
No need,

13:34.840 --> 13:35.220
Mentor.

13:35.670 --> 13:36.700
Just keep it.

13:44.720 --> 13:45.250
Like I said,

13:45.910 --> 13:47.490
curing your swollen neck is to be remunerated

13:47.870 --> 13:48.650
by two gems.

13:49.960 --> 13:50.530
Also,

13:50.790 --> 13:51.700
I picked ten books,

13:52.120 --> 13:53.010
and find myself short of two gems.

13:53.870 --> 13:54.580
Therefore,

13:55.320 --> 13:56.530
adding this to that.

13:58.790 --> 13:59.340
We're even.

14:02.440 --> 14:03.060
You

14:04.550 --> 14:05.850
know your math well.

14:07.120 --> 14:08.060
Speaking of gems,

14:08.750 --> 14:10.100
living here can be costly.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.130
If you need money,

14:12.720 --> 14:13.340
go to Baiji Hall

14:13.790 --> 14:14.490
to take up some tasks

14:14.720 --> 14:15.490
and earn some gems.

14:17.390 --> 14:18.100
Are you sure

14:18.440 --> 14:19.850
I can do that now?

14:21.120 --> 14:22.220
Just tell them you have my permission.

14:24.600 --> 14:25.130
Thank you, Mentor.

14:29.960 --> 14:30.820
Mentor Ye

14:31.480 --> 14:33.250
is focusing on wood carving,

14:34.150 --> 14:35.730
yet I can't help but feel watched.

14:36.750 --> 14:37.580
Can someone

14:38.320 --> 14:39.700
do two things at once?

14:40.270 --> 14:41.130
Come in.

14:52.840 --> 14:53.700
Greetings, Mentor Ye.

14:55.080 --> 14:56.300
Here for a task?

14:56.910 --> 14:58.490
It's your first time, and you came alone.

14:59.000 --> 15:00.770
Should I give you a rundown?

15:05.000 --> 15:05.980
Tame a beast.

15:06.870 --> 15:07.700
50 gems.

15:10.030 --> 15:10.700
That's a lot.

15:13.100 --> 15:14.380
[Tame a Beast]

15:16.910 --> 15:18.180
But taming a beast

15:18.600 --> 15:19.490
can be dangerous.

15:19.790 --> 15:21.460
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

15:21.630 --> 15:22.890
If you're too scared for it,

15:23.200 --> 15:23.770
there's this one.

15:25.840 --> 15:26.850
Move a mountain.

15:27.910 --> 15:28.770
100 gems.

15:32.360 --> 15:33.490
Anything simpler for me?

15:34.440 --> 15:35.850
I have no use for that many gems anyway.

15:39.390 --> 15:41.130
If you don't want to take these tasks,

15:41.480 --> 15:43.250
feel free to come back next month.

15:43.550 --> 15:44.130
Mentor Ye,

15:45.360 --> 15:46.730
is the task at Herbs Garden still available?

15:47.080 --> 15:47.940
Can I take that one?

15:50.200 --> 15:52.420
Do you know what kind of place it is?

15:53.550 --> 15:54.890
I looked down once

15:55.030 --> 15:56.100
when I was flying.

15:56.360 --> 15:57.770
I'm confident enough to carry out

15:58.080 --> 15:59.180
a herb-gathering task.

15:59.720 --> 16:01.420
I have to warn you first.

16:01.960 --> 16:03.420
The herbs in the Herbs Garden

16:03.550 --> 16:05.980
are more precious than the disciples here.

16:06.670 --> 16:08.890
If you destroyed one or two herbs,

16:09.320 --> 16:10.650
you would have to pay

16:10.870 --> 16:12.980
more than a few thousand gems.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.010
You don't trust me?

16:20.790 --> 16:21.530
I would like

16:22.270 --> 16:23.420
to give it a try.

16:25.510 --> 16:28.060
A fool never heeds any warning.

16:29.240 --> 16:29.820
Pay up.

16:32.550 --> 16:33.370
I'm here to take up a task.

16:33.870 --> 16:35.180
Why do I have to pay you?

16:36.270 --> 16:38.370
I take 10% of the reward as commission.

16:38.670 --> 16:39.490
It's the rule here.

16:41.000 --> 16:41.890
What about other tasks?

16:43.750 --> 16:44.850
Besides,

16:45.320 --> 16:47.460
to make sure you can't walk away should you destroy the herbs,

16:47.750 --> 16:48.770
you need to pay a small fee

16:48.960 --> 16:51.180
as security deposit to accept this task.

16:54.390 --> 16:56.770
You can't get anywhere without gems here.

16:57.200 --> 16:58.980
You're gemless.

16:59.840 --> 17:01.940
How can you survive in Yellow Maple Valley?

17:03.390 --> 17:04.460
Herbs Garden...

17:10.390 --> 17:12.340
There is a way, though.

17:18.750 --> 17:19.490
Mentor Ye,

17:20.320 --> 17:21.650
will you help me?

17:29.270 --> 17:30.060
Easy.

17:33.510 --> 17:35.220
Don't you have a Foundation Pill?

17:35.720 --> 17:36.420
Sell it to me.

17:37.390 --> 17:39.460
Not only can you own a large amount of gems

17:39.960 --> 17:41.700
but I will also offer you better tasks

17:41.910 --> 17:42.940
for you to choose freely.

17:47.120 --> 17:47.770
Mentor Ye,

17:48.630 --> 17:49.730
you don't have a use

17:49.960 --> 17:51.010
for that Foundation Pill.

17:51.790 --> 17:52.530
Who wants it

17:52.630 --> 17:53.370
from me?

17:53.670 --> 17:55.340
Why does it matter?

17:55.790 --> 17:57.060
You have a fake spirit root.

17:57.480 --> 17:59.180
You can never reach the Foundation Establishment Stage in your life.

17:59.840 --> 18:01.490
You should thank me for purchasing

18:01.910 --> 18:03.060
that pill from you.

18:03.480 --> 18:04.180
I know.

18:05.080 --> 18:06.370
But I plan to seize any chance,

18:07.150 --> 18:07.650
no matter

18:08.030 --> 18:08.770
how slim it is.

18:08.840 --> 18:09.700
200 gems.

18:10.000 --> 18:10.980
And 50 extra.

18:11.720 --> 18:13.130
Don't be too greedy now.

18:13.480 --> 18:15.250
That's 250 gems in total.

18:15.910 --> 18:17.890
You're not strong enough

18:18.510 --> 18:21.130
to keep that pill.

18:22.360 --> 18:24.730
So why hold onto it so dearly?

18:26.200 --> 18:28.250
You wouldn't want to lose your life

18:29.600 --> 18:31.420
for it, would you?

18:37.870 --> 18:38.730
Mentor,

18:40.070 --> 18:41.220
is this a threat?

19:05.590 --> 19:07.330
It seems like I can't leave this place

19:08.310 --> 19:09.490
without surrendering the pill.

19:22.720 --> 19:23.420
Are you sure

19:23.510 --> 19:24.900
you want the task at the Herbs Garden?

19:27.070 --> 19:27.570
Yes.

19:28.750 --> 19:29.420
I want it.

19:34.440 --> 19:35.220
[Herbs Garden]
Show this token

19:35.590 --> 19:37.010
to Mentor Ma.

19:52.920 --> 19:53.620
Perhaps

19:54.200 --> 19:55.420
it is as Mentor Ye said,

19:56.590 --> 19:57.570
I am not strong enough

19:57.920 --> 19:59.380
to keep the Foundation Pill at this moment.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.050
Fortunately,

20:01.480 --> 20:02.700
I got the task at the Herbs Garden.

20:04.030 --> 20:04.700
I can

20:04.750 --> 20:06.140
focus on nurturing herbs

20:06.310 --> 20:07.090
and refining pills

20:07.310 --> 20:08.010
to improve my progress.

20:09.350 --> 20:10.570
I'll find a way eventually

20:11.440 --> 20:12.380
to get the Foundation Pill.

20:18.790 --> 20:19.530
Anyone's here?

20:22.000 --> 20:22.860
Anyone's here?

20:38.960 --> 20:39.810
Anyone's here?

20:41.200 --> 20:42.330
I accepted the task

20:42.790 --> 20:44.250
to tend to the garden.

20:44.480 --> 20:45.050
My name is Han Li.

20:45.680 --> 20:47.220
Is Mentor Ma here?

20:49.160 --> 20:51.220
Who's there shouting?

20:51.720 --> 20:53.980
You're scaring my plants.

21:02.550 --> 21:03.660
Are you Mentor Ma?

21:05.620 --> 21:06.440
[Mentor Ma, Herbs Garden]

21:06.440 --> 21:07.760
Who is Mentor Ma

21:07.880 --> 21:09.010
if not me?

21:15.310 --> 21:16.010
Greetings.

21:16.640 --> 21:17.380
I am...

21:17.640 --> 21:18.490
Han Li.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.620
This is Herbs Garden.

21:27.480 --> 21:28.460
It has

21:28.680 --> 21:30.420
millions of herbs.

21:32.960 --> 21:33.940
You want to stay here?

21:35.750 --> 21:36.530
Count

21:36.720 --> 21:38.700
how many plants there are here.

21:39.640 --> 21:40.900
If you get it wrong,

21:42.830 --> 21:44.140
don't come back tomorrow.

21:45.110 --> 21:45.900
Counting herbs?

21:48.590 --> 21:49.770
Count them

21:50.070 --> 21:51.490
and you'll know how many you've killed.

21:51.750 --> 21:52.490
Then,

21:52.790 --> 21:53.620
I'll ask you to pay for it.

21:54.830 --> 21:56.010
You just have to pay up.

21:58.790 --> 21:59.220
Yes.

22:13.350 --> 22:14.250
1,723.

22:14.920 --> 22:15.810
1,724.

22:16.640 --> 22:17.530
1,725.

22:18.270 --> 22:19.220
1,726.

22:22.020 --> 22:24.860
[Dong Xuan'er, Yellow Maple Valley]

22:25.200 --> 22:26.380
There is a total of

22:26.440 --> 22:28.250
7,123 herbs here.

22:34.880 --> 22:35.810
1,727.

22:36.110 --> 22:38.090
1,728.

22:38.270 --> 22:39.490
1,7...

22:39.640 --> 22:41.140
- 1,729. - I come here to paint every day

22:41.270 --> 22:43.420
so I remember every plant vividly.

22:43.640 --> 22:44.460
I can't get it wrong.

22:44.590 --> 22:46.570
1,739.

22:47.310 --> 22:48.620
You must be new here.

22:50.240 --> 22:51.290
1,7...

22:56.960 --> 22:57.420
Oh, no.

22:58.510 --> 22:59.700
She's using a trick.

23:00.830 --> 23:01.980
She's more powerful than I.

23:02.920 --> 23:03.420
I must leave.

23:04.480 --> 23:04.900
Wait.

23:07.790 --> 23:08.530
What is it?

23:13.920 --> 23:14.460
What are you doing?

23:15.830 --> 23:16.460
Stay still.

23:16.720 --> 23:17.730
Let me look at you.

23:19.590 --> 23:21.250
You look plain.

23:21.790 --> 23:23.530
Your talent is also ordinary.

23:25.440 --> 23:26.490
But you have great eyes.

23:26.790 --> 23:27.460
Very clear.

23:30.030 --> 23:30.700
Miss,

23:31.000 --> 23:31.730
take care.

23:35.590 --> 23:36.980
You don't like people looking at you?

23:37.440 --> 23:38.700
I don't like to be stared at.

23:39.240 --> 23:40.140
Your stare

23:40.680 --> 23:41.900
makes me uncomfortable.

23:47.550 --> 23:49.090
Do you get nervous when you see me?

23:50.550 --> 23:51.220
Don't worry.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.420
In this garden,

23:52.440 --> 23:53.860
other than herbs,

23:54.030 --> 23:55.360
you hardly find any humans here.

23:55.510 --> 23:56.400
Relax.

23:57.270 --> 23:57.700
Don't move.

23:58.920 --> 24:01.380
No. 91 on the rare insect list, Chelonian Beetle.

24:04.920 --> 24:05.940
Look at its long horn.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.660
Its black and white horn points at the sky.

24:07.880 --> 24:08.730
How strong.

24:09.440 --> 24:10.940
And look at its fine hair

24:11.200 --> 24:13.180
that gives out a green hue under the sunlight.

24:13.310 --> 24:13.900
It's beautiful.

24:14.030 --> 24:15.250
It's like a war general.

24:16.400 --> 24:17.290
What rare insect list?

24:17.720 --> 24:19.010
Even insects have a ranking?

24:30.070 --> 24:30.620
That's right.

24:30.830 --> 24:32.140
If there is a ranking for cultivators,

24:32.310 --> 24:34.090
the bugs and the plants can have one too.

24:34.790 --> 24:36.380
Don't underestimate this garden.

24:36.510 --> 24:38.420
There's more than meets the eye.

24:41.270 --> 24:41.770
Indeed.

24:43.030 --> 24:44.250
This cultivation sanctuary

24:44.830 --> 24:45.860
is otherworldly.

24:51.550 --> 24:52.420
What was the last number again?

24:55.550 --> 24:56.250
I lost count.

25:01.240 --> 25:02.220
Can you stop staring at me?

25:03.790 --> 25:04.290
One.

25:04.790 --> 25:05.250
Two.

25:05.400 --> 25:07.730
But weren't we born to be admired?

25:08.000 --> 25:10.250
Look at the bugs and the plants.

25:10.590 --> 25:11.770
They don't care about us,

25:11.880 --> 25:12.980
so they are happy.

25:13.680 --> 25:15.250
You shouldn't care if others are looking at you or not.

25:17.680 --> 25:18.730
This garden

25:19.200 --> 25:20.290
has a lot of eccentric people.

25:21.680 --> 25:23.220
I don't want any attention.

25:25.510 --> 25:26.220
That said,

25:27.030 --> 25:28.900
she seems to be quite familiar with this place.

25:29.790 --> 25:30.940
Perhaps I can learn from her.

25:35.790 --> 25:36.380
Greetings.

25:37.000 --> 25:37.700
I am Han Li.

25:38.110 --> 25:39.250
How may I address you?

25:40.750 --> 25:42.530
Oh, you're the one with the Ascension Token.

25:44.110 --> 25:45.770
I don't mean to look down at you.

25:46.240 --> 25:47.180
I am Dong Xuan'er.

25:47.350 --> 25:48.980
We're now friends.

25:51.070 --> 25:51.900
Miss,

25:52.000 --> 25:53.420
do you work in this garden as well?

25:54.110 --> 25:55.770
She is the Dong Xuan'er.

25:56.240 --> 25:57.980
No one can order her around.

25:59.400 --> 25:59.900
Mentor Ma.

26:00.030 --> 26:00.810
Mentor Ma.

26:01.400 --> 26:01.810
Good.

26:02.160 --> 26:03.620
Since you two have met,

26:03.720 --> 26:05.130
I don't need to make a lengthy

26:05.160 --> 26:06.090
introduction.

26:06.590 --> 26:07.380
This is Han Li.

26:07.550 --> 26:08.290
Dong Xuan'er

26:08.480 --> 26:10.050
is different from others.

26:10.270 --> 26:11.770
She is the direct disciple

26:12.110 --> 26:13.420
of a Core Formation Stage cultivator.

26:13.750 --> 26:14.250
She

26:14.750 --> 26:15.810
sees things differently

26:15.960 --> 26:17.730
in comparison to you.

26:17.960 --> 26:18.730
Don't waste

26:18.790 --> 26:20.140
your time with her.

26:22.030 --> 26:22.660
Understood.

26:28.880 --> 26:30.380
This is an excellent bug.

26:30.680 --> 26:31.660
What do you think?

26:32.880 --> 26:33.730
It is good.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.900
Raise it for another decade or so

26:36.030 --> 26:38.090
and it will become grade 2.

26:40.480 --> 26:41.860
Keen eyes.

26:43.310 --> 26:44.620
The universe is predestined

26:44.750 --> 26:46.010
as countless lives were brought to this world.

26:46.590 --> 26:47.380
They exist,

26:47.480 --> 26:48.980
so we should learn to admire them.

26:49.440 --> 26:50.050
Don't you think so?

26:51.000 --> 26:51.490
Han Li.

27:06.070 --> 27:07.220
She sees the beauty in everything.

27:08.440 --> 27:09.010
Perhaps

27:09.880 --> 27:10.980
this is another way of cultivating too.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.380
This garden

27:15.920 --> 27:16.860
is wonderful.

27:17.750 --> 27:18.380
I love it.

27:26.350 --> 27:28.140
How is your day?

27:28.790 --> 27:30.530
You don't look happy.

27:32.750 --> 27:34.140
Be happy.

27:36.310 --> 27:36.940
Mentor Ma.

27:38.030 --> 27:38.660
How many

27:39.000 --> 27:40.290
did you count today?

27:41.350 --> 27:42.420
If we count the ones on the surface,

27:42.790 --> 27:44.380
there are 7,123 plants.

27:44.830 --> 27:47.290
If we include Jade Wyrm Root that grows underground,

27:47.790 --> 27:48.250
we have

27:48.680 --> 27:50.140
7,177 plants here.

27:52.680 --> 27:53.860
Wrong.

27:54.920 --> 27:55.810
I counted twice.

27:56.070 --> 27:56.700
I am very sure.

27:57.830 --> 27:58.460
Seven thousand,

27:58.920 --> 27:59.460
one hundred,

27:59.830 --> 28:01.050
and eighty-two plants.

28:02.550 --> 28:03.180
Impossible.

28:04.590 --> 28:04.980
Impossible.

28:05.310 --> 28:05.980
That's impossible.

28:08.590 --> 28:09.530
There are five plants

28:09.680 --> 28:10.620
in my hands.

28:18.070 --> 28:18.770
Anyway, you passed.

28:18.880 --> 28:19.330
Take them.

28:20.680 --> 28:21.250
You

28:21.440 --> 28:22.330
barely pass.

28:22.920 --> 28:23.730
Thank you, Mentor Ma.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.180
Can I stay here?

28:27.240 --> 28:27.730
Mentor Ma,

28:28.110 --> 28:29.250
I've tended to herbs before.

28:29.880 --> 28:30.700
Please be reassured.

28:33.720 --> 28:34.980
Wait here.

28:42.880 --> 28:43.770
Don't gawk.

29:13.400 --> 29:13.940
Han Li,

29:14.270 --> 29:14.900
come here.

29:18.880 --> 29:20.620
I told you that if you killed

29:20.880 --> 29:22.330
any plants,

29:22.880 --> 29:24.180
you'd have to pay.

29:24.310 --> 29:25.490
Did you have a backup plan

29:25.510 --> 29:26.460
in your mind already?

29:26.790 --> 29:27.620
I'll do my best.

29:28.720 --> 29:29.290
Good.

29:29.720 --> 29:30.900
Write down anything.

29:31.310 --> 29:31.730
Anyway,

29:32.350 --> 29:33.330
take care of this garden.

29:33.480 --> 29:34.250
I'm going to cultivate in isolation.

29:35.110 --> 29:36.250
You can stay here for the moment.

29:37.270 --> 29:37.810
It makes it easier

29:37.920 --> 29:38.860
for you to manage this place.

29:39.550 --> 29:40.700
I'll return

29:40.880 --> 29:41.730
after one season.

29:42.110 --> 29:43.090
After we harvest them,

29:43.550 --> 29:44.810
you will be rewarded

29:44.960 --> 29:46.090
with plenty of gems.

29:46.640 --> 29:47.050
Do you understand?

29:47.790 --> 29:48.810
Please put your mind at ease, Mentor Ma.

29:49.270 --> 29:50.010
Also,

29:50.720 --> 29:52.180
do not disturb me.

30:08.550 --> 30:09.290
Mentor Ye!

30:11.240 --> 30:12.010
Mentor Ye!

30:13.310 --> 30:15.460
Where did that old man go?

30:23.270 --> 30:24.660
He's often away during the day.

30:24.680 --> 30:26.620
I see he has been tinkering with puppets.

30:27.590 --> 30:28.810
It seems like he is adept

30:28.830 --> 30:30.290
in puppetry.

30:32.680 --> 30:33.730
This is huge.

30:34.000 --> 30:35.010
Wow.

30:35.830 --> 30:37.940
I won't be able to defeat him when I fight him.

30:39.070 --> 30:40.660
That ancient fool.

30:42.270 --> 30:43.420
You're so early.

30:44.480 --> 30:46.290
Are you here to snatch up new tasks?

30:47.200 --> 30:47.730
Mentor Ye,

30:50.200 --> 30:50.900
I heard

30:51.440 --> 30:52.980
you have obtained a Foundation Pill.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.420
I came to thank you.

30:54.920 --> 30:56.180
Why thank me?

30:57.510 --> 30:59.140
An ancient fool like me made a promise

30:59.640 --> 31:01.420
to a fledgling fool like you.

31:02.400 --> 31:02.940
Then

31:03.350 --> 31:04.140
when can I

31:04.160 --> 31:05.730
have the pill?

31:05.830 --> 31:07.050
Be patient.

31:08.200 --> 31:08.980
Just wait.

31:12.350 --> 31:13.620
The disciples will be arriving soon

31:13.640 --> 31:14.620
to accept new tasks.

31:15.750 --> 31:17.330
If you don't mind that they find out about this deal,

31:17.510 --> 31:18.490
you can wait for me here.

31:19.000 --> 31:19.860
Once they are gone,

31:20.070 --> 31:21.010
I'll let you know.

31:21.590 --> 31:22.180
Come in.

31:22.350 --> 31:23.420
Come get your tasks.

31:24.270 --> 31:25.140
Morning, Mentor Ye.

31:25.240 --> 31:25.940
Morning.

31:28.750 --> 31:29.530
Pick whatever task

31:29.720 --> 31:30.380
you like.

31:34.110 --> 31:35.220
Which idiot

31:35.480 --> 31:36.620
took the task in Herbs Garden?

31:37.640 --> 31:39.290
Does he not know how odd Mentor Ma is?

31:39.550 --> 31:41.220
Or how dangerous the herbs are?

31:41.830 --> 31:43.010
Who else can it be?

31:43.480 --> 31:44.290
Who?

31:44.550 --> 31:46.050
The one with the Ascension Token.

31:48.440 --> 31:49.380
So he took it.

31:49.720 --> 31:50.490
It's over for him.

31:50.880 --> 31:51.770
The Herbs Garden

31:52.030 --> 31:54.010
will be his final stop in Yellow Maple Valley.

31:55.070 --> 31:56.050
This garden

31:56.400 --> 31:58.180
is no different from the garden in Shenshou Valley.

31:59.160 --> 31:59.980
It's only bigger in scale.

32:00.830 --> 32:01.330
I can do it.

32:06.880 --> 32:08.330
Water the root and not the leaves.

32:09.550 --> 32:11.420
You need eight hours of sun.

32:20.110 --> 32:21.460
Looking after these plants

32:22.160 --> 32:23.380
feels so much better than hanging out

32:23.440 --> 32:24.090
with those

32:24.350 --> 32:25.140
scheming disciples.

32:29.960 --> 32:31.140
The sun is bright.

32:39.880 --> 32:40.940
Soak it in.

32:41.070 --> 32:41.660
Grow faster.

32:41.920 --> 32:43.290
Bear me more fruits.

32:43.920 --> 32:45.420
My path to riches

32:46.000 --> 32:46.810
depends on you.

33:29.500 --> 33:32.740
♪The cloud and the sky are always on each other's side♪

33:37.780 --> 33:40.980
♪Time and time again, it never changes♪

33:43.540 --> 33:46.020
♪You appear among the stars♪

33:47.540 --> 33:50.020
♪Taking away my emptiness♪

33:53.460 --> 33:57.260
♪I want to admire the landscape with you♪

34:01.660 --> 34:04.780
♪I'm a speck of dust in the sky♪

34:09.860 --> 34:13.580
♪Turning back, you're there♪

34:15.500 --> 34:18.140
♪Unafraid of the winding journey♪

34:18.420 --> 34:19.380
[Tier 11, Qi Refining Stage]

34:19.380 --> 34:22.180
♪We promised to enter the dream together♪

34:25.820 --> 34:29.380
♪I fight only for you for the rest of my life♪

34:33.140 --> 34:36.260
♪Let time sweep through♪

34:36.900 --> 34:40.100
♪The mountains♪

34:41.340 --> 34:44.020
♪Thoughts turn♪

34:44.580 --> 34:47.900
♪Into a thousand sails♪

34:48.860 --> 34:50.500
♪Despite the distance♪

34:50.940 --> 34:52.700
♪If our heart connects♪

34:53.780 --> 34:56.340
♪It's as if we've never left each other♪

34:56.820 --> 34:58.420
♪Searching and searching♪

34:59.740 --> 35:03.660
♪For your whereabouts♪

35:05.020 --> 35:07.980
♪Fate can besiege me♪

35:08.860 --> 35:11.940
♪With a thousand obstacles♪

35:13.140 --> 35:15.900
♪Courage turn♪

35:16.700 --> 35:19.940
♪Into a thousand sails♪

35:21.180 --> 35:22.500
♪The fate is sealed when we lock eyes♪

35:23.020 --> 35:24.620
♪Never turning back on this wayward journey♪

35:25.540 --> 35:28.260
♪Looking back at shared memories♪

35:28.740 --> 35:30.300
♪The long night ends♪

35:31.460 --> 35:35.580
♪As I fly to the shore where you belong♪

35:52.280 --> 35:53.010
When you

35:53.030 --> 35:54.420
accepted the task in Herbs Garden,

35:55.320 --> 35:56.300
I thought

35:57.070 --> 35:58.340
Ye somehow tricked you into it.

35:59.320 --> 36:00.210
It seems like

36:01.230 --> 36:02.690
not only are you good with the art of healing,

36:03.670 --> 36:04.820
you have a talent

36:05.000 --> 36:06.050
for herbal horticulture too.

36:06.800 --> 36:07.260
Not bad.

36:13.440 --> 36:14.340
Mentor Wu,

36:15.110 --> 36:16.420
I merely make use of what I have.

36:17.000 --> 36:17.490
I owe it all

36:17.800 --> 36:19.690
to your trust in me.

36:21.230 --> 36:22.940
It seems like you have mastered the Telepathy skill

36:23.190 --> 36:24.300
that I taught you last time.

36:26.800 --> 36:27.420
I'm leaving.

36:27.630 --> 36:28.340
It's not over yet.

36:28.960 --> 36:29.530
It's not over yet?

36:29.960 --> 36:30.820
Sure. Come.

36:44.400 --> 36:44.980
That feels great.

36:45.800 --> 36:46.300
That's the spot.

36:51.070 --> 36:51.900
Tell me honestly.

36:52.550 --> 36:53.210
What techniques

36:53.230 --> 36:54.530
do you want this time?

36:55.230 --> 36:55.780
I want them all.

36:57.280 --> 36:58.210
I'm not talented

36:58.670 --> 36:59.650
and I joined late.

37:00.280 --> 37:01.170
I have too many things

37:01.400 --> 37:02.340
that I want to learn.

37:14.320 --> 37:14.820
Done.

37:22.480 --> 37:22.940
Okay.

37:24.190 --> 37:24.900
I'll teach you

37:26.880 --> 37:27.820
this technique today.

37:28.590 --> 37:29.130
Watch carefully.

37:37.670 --> 37:38.780
This is Freeze.

37:51.000 --> 37:52.130
This is Quicksand.

37:54.110 --> 37:56.130
Don't underestimate these two tricks.

37:56.630 --> 37:58.460
When used by someone powerful enough,

37:58.880 --> 38:00.820
acres of land can turn into desert.

38:00.960 --> 38:02.780
Raging rivers can turn into glaciers.

38:04.960 --> 38:05.490
Try it.

38:26.110 --> 38:26.820
Not bad

38:26.840 --> 38:27.650
for a first try.

38:28.000 --> 38:28.650
Don't rush it.

38:29.000 --> 38:30.340
The efficiency of your spell

38:30.670 --> 38:32.170
depends on

38:32.190 --> 38:33.340
your ability

38:33.630 --> 38:34.940
and your proficiency.

38:35.440 --> 38:36.260
You are not talented,

38:36.710 --> 38:37.610
but you're diligent.

38:38.280 --> 38:39.130
In time,

38:39.590 --> 38:40.490
it will pay off.

38:43.030 --> 38:43.650
Thank you, Mentor.

38:45.000 --> 38:45.570
I'm leaving now.

38:48.400 --> 38:49.300
Also,

38:49.480 --> 38:50.460
when do I come back next?

38:52.150 --> 38:53.010
As often as you want.

38:53.550 --> 38:54.050
All right.

38:55.440 --> 38:56.780
Practice the spells regularly.

39:16.920 --> 39:18.300
Not too shabby.

39:18.510 --> 39:20.340
You've tended to the garden well.

39:23.840 --> 39:25.090
It's all thanks to your notes.

39:25.630 --> 39:27.090
I merely replicated them.

39:27.510 --> 39:28.610
Besides, the weather helped me

39:29.000 --> 39:29.780
to achieve

39:30.320 --> 39:31.170
the results too.

39:38.880 --> 39:39.380
Mentor,

39:40.230 --> 39:41.650
since you know herbs so well,

39:41.880 --> 39:43.130
surely you're well-versed

39:43.440 --> 39:44.210
in alchemy too.

39:47.440 --> 39:48.980
Nonsense.

39:50.150 --> 39:50.740
My apologies.

39:53.480 --> 39:54.090
But

39:54.480 --> 39:55.940
I see lights on the wall

39:56.230 --> 39:57.900
at the loo every night.

39:58.510 --> 39:59.300
I suppose

39:59.590 --> 40:00.610
that is the doing

40:00.840 --> 40:02.460
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪

40:03.030 --> 40:03.570
Hence

40:04.070 --> 40:04.980
my question.

40:08.400 --> 40:09.610
If you have the time

40:09.630 --> 40:11.460
to study these things,

40:12.400 --> 40:14.050
it means you have too much time on your hands.

40:19.110 --> 40:19.610
Mentor,

40:20.000 --> 40:21.530
will you give me a few recipes?

40:22.400 --> 40:23.090
Truth be told,

40:23.760 --> 40:24.570
I want to try

40:24.920 --> 40:25.860
refining a pill.

40:32.550 --> 40:33.010
You

40:33.070 --> 40:34.610
are asking for too much.

40:35.190 --> 40:36.210
I spent more than a decade

40:36.510 --> 40:37.570
to come up

40:37.800 --> 40:39.490
with those recipes.

40:40.150 --> 40:42.530
I can't give them to you for free.

40:43.190 --> 40:44.210
Even rough drafts will do.

40:44.510 --> 40:45.260
I can experiment with them myself.

40:52.550 --> 40:53.740
This is a different story.

40:54.280 --> 40:55.420
You passed my trial

40:55.840 --> 40:57.340
at this garden.

40:58.150 --> 40:59.420
But the real challenge

40:59.840 --> 41:00.780
is

41:00.920 --> 41:02.090
doing it consistently.

41:02.840 --> 41:03.460
From now on,

41:03.800 --> 41:05.260
I will drop by every six months.

41:05.670 --> 41:07.050
Take care of this garden.

41:07.760 --> 41:08.610
Do your job well

41:11.960 --> 41:12.860
and you'll

41:13.360 --> 41:14.490
have enough gems

41:14.710 --> 41:16.260
to buy whatever recipes you want.

41:20.150 --> 41:20.860
Thank you, Mentor.

41:32.840 --> 41:34.610
If you truly want recipes,

41:35.150 --> 41:36.380
bring gems with you

41:36.880 --> 41:37.980
to Lushan Hall.

41:38.230 --> 41:39.420
Tell the person in charge

41:39.590 --> 41:41.170
that I told you to go there.

41:44.030 --> 41:45.380
Don't tell anyone.

41:46.760 --> 41:47.820
Thank you so much, Mentor.

42:22.190 --> 42:23.300
You've arrived at Lushan Hall.

42:24.630 --> 42:25.860
How dare you walk in

42:26.030 --> 42:27.820
without gems?

42:31.140 --> 42:33.030
[Mentor Xu, Lushan Hall]

42:33.030 --> 42:34.050
You may borrow books,

42:35.760 --> 42:36.900
make copies,

42:37.190 --> 42:39.170
or rent the alchemy room

42:40.550 --> 42:41.420
but

42:41.880 --> 42:44.740
you need gems for that.

42:51.400 --> 42:52.690
He's mid-tier of the Foundation Establishment Stage.

42:54.230 --> 42:55.940
I know who you are.

42:56.510 --> 42:57.300
I am the one with...

42:57.360 --> 42:58.530
A fake spirit root.

43:00.480 --> 43:01.570
Indeed, Mentor.

43:01.590 --> 43:03.050
Don't call me Mentor. I don't like that.

43:03.070 --> 43:04.490
My surname is Xu. Call me Xu.

43:05.000 --> 43:05.490
Elder Xu.

43:05.510 --> 43:06.340
Xu.

43:06.360 --> 43:06.820
Mentor Xu.

43:06.840 --> 43:07.420
Xu.

43:07.840 --> 43:08.940
Elder...

43:08.960 --> 43:10.210
Come.

43:18.440 --> 43:19.740
Go to the right for refinement.

43:21.760 --> 43:22.210
Right?

43:22.440 --> 43:23.380
Your right.

43:25.320 --> 43:27.170
Go to the left for browsing books.

43:28.960 --> 43:32.090
One gem every two hours.

43:32.110 --> 43:34.130
Do not bring anything outside.

43:35.630 --> 43:36.420
Duly noted.

43:53.590 --> 43:54.340
Elder Xu,

43:54.400 --> 43:55.980
please don't tell anyone I came here.

44:32.420 --> 44:37.740
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

44:38.980 --> 44:44.380
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

44:44.500 --> 44:47.700
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

44:47.940 --> 44:50.180
♪Old scenes rise again♪

44:50.580 --> 44:53.420
♪Too hard to forget♪

44:53.940 --> 44:57.900
♪Easier just to miss♪

44:58.740 --> 45:04.220
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

45:05.380 --> 45:10.660
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

45:11.260 --> 45:14.300
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

45:14.580 --> 45:16.700
♪Swept away by time♪

45:17.340 --> 45:19.980
♪Eyes once looked far♪

45:20.460 --> 45:24.420
♪Now lost in the shift♪

45:24.900 --> 45:27.740
♪Autumn winds stir♪

45:28.020 --> 45:29.940
♪Smoke curls once more♪

45:30.380 --> 45:32.820
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

45:33.140 --> 45:36.660
♪Returning to my eyes♪

45:37.220 --> 45:40.180
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

45:40.500 --> 45:43.420
♪Time lost its name♪

45:43.820 --> 45:46.660
♪Was it yesterday♪

45:47.060 --> 45:50.620
♪Or tomorrow?♪

45:50.980 --> 45:53.820
♪The world has changed♪

45:54.220 --> 45:56.060
♪Beyond recall♪

45:56.620 --> 45:58.340
♪Time will fade♪

45:58.740 --> 46:03.540
♪All the words ever spoken♪

46:04.220 --> 46:07.100
♪Only this longing remains♪

46:07.580 --> 46:12.860
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

46:13.980 --> 46:20.620
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

46:21.100 --> 46:30.820
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
